        <mxCell id="c3" value="AgentDecompile — the recovery pipeline, end to end" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=30;fontColor=#f2f4f7;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="L1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20.5" width="906" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c4" value="Reading order: left → right is dependency order. Anything stacked vertically in a bracketed lane runs concurrently. Every card answers: what we're trying to do · how · what goes in and comes out · what gates it." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=14;fontColor=#98a0ad;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="L1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="69.3" width="1660.24" height="19.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c941" value="" style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L1"><mxGeometry x="2700" y="22" width="1660" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c5" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#20232a;strokeColor=#f0c060;strokeWidth=1.2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c941"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="1660" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c6" value="HOW TO READ THIS IN 20 SECONDS" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=12;fontColor=#f0c060;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c941"><mxGeometry x="12" y="9.4" width="222" height="16.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c7" value="1. Follow the top row left→right: that is the order things must happen." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c941"><mxGeometry x="12" y="29.92" width="463.24" height="16.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c8" value="2. Everything inside the bracket runs at the same time as that row — the only waits are the five locks." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c941"><mxGeometry x="12" y="45.92" width="669.32" height="16.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c9" value="3. When a lookup fails, read down its ladder; the bottom band is what you actually get." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c941"><mxGeometry x="12" y="61.92" width="566.28" height="16.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c10" value="The bar: a level above conventional RE tools. They end at analysis a human must work with; this ends at usable exports — packs, generated bindings, headers, readiness reports — ready to go." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=14;fontColor=#f0c060;fontStyle=2;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="L1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="93.3" width="1487.76" height="19.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c11" value="Runs on a laptop; scales by concurrency, then by donated idle compute and free cloud nodes; every task miniature and non-blocking; working state concurrent and network-capable — a single stateful device is never the coordination point." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#98a0ad;fontStyle=2;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="L1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="114.88" width="1651" height="17.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c942" value="" style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L2"><mxGeometry x="40" y="140" width="4320" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c12" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#25503e;strokeColor=none;opacity=85;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c942"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="4320" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c13" value="MAIN PIPELINE — recover once on the easiest build, propagate to every sibling, prove byte identity" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=14;fontColor=#f2f4f7;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c942"><mxGeometry x="12" y="7.3" width="829.2" height="19.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c14" value="eight named stages · do not reorder · skip any step whose receipt already exists" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#7fd6a4;fontStyle=2;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c942"><mxGeometry x="3786.8" y="9.92" width="521.2" height="16.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c943" value="" style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L2"><mxGeometry x="40" y="190" width="400" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c15" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#20232a;strokeColor=#3a3f4a;strokeWidth=1.2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="400" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c16" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#2c2f36;strokeColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="400" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c17" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#2c2f36;strokeColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="0" y="22" width="400" height="8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c18" value="0" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=13;fontColor=#f2f4f7;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="10" y="6.35" width="13.8" height="18.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c19" value="Open · add · resume (priority-zero)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=13.5;fontColor=#f2f4f7;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="44" y="5.83" width="289.5" height="18.9" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c20" value="Trying to:" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#b0b6c2;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="10" y="36.97" width="69" height="14.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c21" value="Start from the actual project, never a setup ritual:" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="10" y="50.92" width="340.88" height="16.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c22" value="opening a project, adding binaries or resuming prior" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="10" y="65.93" width="340.88" height="16.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c23" value="work starts analysis BY ITSELF — there is no Start button." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="10" y="80.93" width="379.52" height="16.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c24" value="How:" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#b0b6c2;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="10" y="100.97" width="31.2" height="14.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c25" value="• reconcile bindings, corpus records, REUSE every receipt" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=11;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="10" y="115.45" width="357.12" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c26" value="• gate ONLY mutation admission — reads never wait" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=11;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="10" y="129.95" width="307.84" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c27" value="• the one control is pause/resume (+ scope), never start" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=11;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="10" y="144.45" width="350.96" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c28" value="• checkpoint-trusting; repair only on detected breakage:" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=11;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="10" y="158.95" width="350.96" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c29" value="•   NULL content_sha256 / mixed basis_hash → receipted" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=11;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="10" y="173.45" width="338.64" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c30" value="•   backfill, never auto-run" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=11;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="10" y="187.95" width="178.48" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c31" value="• never re-analyze a program that already has analysis" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=11;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="10" y="202.45" width="338.64" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c32" value="• new import admits work; reopening admits nothing" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=11;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="10" y="216.95" width="314" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c33" value="In → out:" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#b0b6c2;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="10" y="235.97" width="62.7" height="14.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c34" value="in: .gpr / repo / binaries / prior receipts" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=11;fontColor=#98a0ad;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="10" y="250.45" width="270.88" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c35" value="out: one active project, known state, no duplicate work" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=11;fontColor=#98a0ad;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="10" y="264.95" width="344.8" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c36" value="Gate: " style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#f0c060;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="10" y="283.97" width="43.8" height="14.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c37" value="mutation-admission only (real owner state)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=11;fontColor=#f0c060;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="c943"><mxGeometry x="46" y="283.45" width="264.72" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
